# IMPORTANT: the repository ships byte-identical payloads to what is installed
# into $DSH_HOME/skills, and manifests/skills.lock.json pins every file's sha256.
# Disable all EOL/text normalization so `git clone` reproduces the exact bytes
# that were hashed. (Third-party skills may contain CRLF; normalizing would
# break verify on a fresh clone.)
* -text

*.tar.gz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
